<P><STRONG><IMG src="http://www.rickygervais.com/images/rickyasandy.gif" align=left border=0>THE OFFICE</STRONG><STRONG> star Gervais met the MATERIAL GIRL backstage at Saturday's (02JUL05) London Live 8 concert,</STRONG> and begged him to give her a part in his eagerly-awaited sitcom - which already boasts the talents of Hollywood A-listers including SAMUEL L JACKSON, BEN STILLER and KATE WINSLET.</P>
<P><STRONG>She says, "I bumped into Ricky earlier on and he asked, 'Who are you?' I said I'd sweep the floor for him if he would employ me."</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>Gervais</STRONG> adds, "I know it's a charity event but you've got to take advantage of opportunities. Madonna asked me for a part, we shook hands and I said, <STRONG>'You do know that's a verbal contract.'</STRONG>" </SPAN></P>
